          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=\"frontend\"} | kind=\"api-timing\" | failureKind=\"network\" [$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The fetch rejected without a response: offline, DNS, TLS, CORS. Invisible to every other service, and the reason this panel exists \u2014 in an app that queues events offline, a call that never landed can mean a recorded action the server never saw. Cancellations are excluded; they are counted as `aborted`, not as trouble."
    },
